=== Ushma — Thermodynamics Demo ===

--- Heat Conduction (Fourier's Law) ---
Copper wall (5cm, 1cm²): 6416.0 W for ΔT = 80 K

--- Convection (Newton's Cooling) ---
Forced convection (h=25, A=1m²): 1500.0 W for ΔT = 60 K

--- Radiation (Stefan-Boltzmann) ---
Hot surface (ε=0.9, A=1m², 200°C): 2180.8 W radiated

--- Ideal Gas Law ---
1 mol at STP: V = 0.0224 m³ (22.41 L)
2 mol at 400K in 50L: P = 133031 Pa (1.31 atm)

--- Material Properties (at ~300 K) ---
Material              k (W/m⋅K) c_p (J/kg⋅K)   α (m²/s)
--------------------------------------------------------
Copper                  401.000        385.0    1.16e-4
Aluminum                237.000        897.0    9.79e-5
