--- Cooling Curve (lumped capacitance) ---
  t =    0s → T = 373.1 K (100.0 °C)
  t =   30s → T = 355.5 K (82.3 °C)
  t =   60s → T = 341.7 K (68.5 °C)
  t =  120s → T = 322.6 K (49.4 °C)
  t =  300s → T = 299.7 K (26.6 °C)
  t =  600s → T = 293.7 K (20.5 °C)

